      "image": "videos/01-brain-decides-first/3.jpg",
      "seconds": 25.38,
      "text": "Think of your consciousness as a press secretary. It doesn't write the policy. It walks up to the podium after the order is already signed, and announces it as its own idea. But Libet believed you keep one power. The veto. You may not start the action... but in that final instant, you might still be able to stop it.",
